# ADR-deviation marker — feat/184-oauth-token
- date: 2026-09-21
- branch: feat/184-oauth-token
- adr_governing: none — confirmed no ADR governs harness auth env vars
- outcome: ADR-honored

Change extends `_docker_harness_preflight_v2` to accept EITHER
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OR CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN per #184. No ADR pins
the auth env var set. RFC-0002 R9 anticorruption layer (documented
in entry.sh L19) names the pass-through env vars — this change ADDS
one, does not remove or repurpose. Adopter-compat preserved:
API-key-only setups still pass preflight (backward-compat test
covers).

No new ADR filed. Change is additive per the ticket spec.
